[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4932474727","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121155#issuecomment-4932474727","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121155","id":4932474727,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJf-XZw","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-10T06:03:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T06:22:24Z","body":"> Can you validate that 'auto entering pip' still works as expected.\r\n\r\nYes, it still works.\r\n\r\n> 'Auto entering' is triggered automatically by the system so `enterPipMode` is not invoked, but in theory it should still work because the behavior is off by default, and enabling it requires calling `updatePipParams(...)`.\r\n\r\nExactly. Godot app needs to call `DisplayServer.pip_mode_set_auto_enter_on_background(true)` to enable this feature, which calls `updatePipParams(...)`.\r\n\r\nBTW `enterPipMode` should always be called, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/370b759037cf4bafd8f7904fc31551a5505efd22/platform/android/java/lib/src/main/java/org/godotengine/godot/GodotActivity.kt#L369-L374\r\n\r\nEdit: Ok I got what you mean, setting `setAutoEnterEnabled(true)` enters pip automatically without waiting for `onUserLeaveHint`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4932474727/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4936864237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121155#issuecomment-4936864237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121155","id":4936864237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJkKR7Q","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-10T15:26:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T15:26:24Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4936864237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"